?","stats":[]},{"id":"6a78dea7-ee35-5f5d-87dc-69dc4ead2bba","title":"Our comprehensive service covers you from application to approval.","strapi_id":17,"strapi_component":"modules.our-services","slider":null,"is_grid":null,"grid_count":null,"design_title":{"data":{"design_title":""}},"cta":null,"services":[{"strapi_id":99,"description":"\n\nPerfect for clients, whether local or international, who have limited time. We handle property transfers on your behalf. With us as your POA, you can travel abroad while we manage all your matters.","id":"32875aaf-5c2f-52d9-9519-0271694f581c","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Power_of_Attorney_dbf3819f29.jpg"},"cta":{"cta_label":"Power of Attorney","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"e2bfc90b-da36-51f9-b53c-377bfa6167a0","strapi_id":205,"menu":null}},{"strapi_id":97,"description":"Expert guidance on family property transfers. We manage documentation, ensure compliance, and tackle any challenges for a smooth and efficient process.","id":"a2407f57-4ec1-5f2e-8101-5157dded82d8","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Gifting_fc554d03cf.jpg"},"cta":{"cta_label":"Property Gifting","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"ce859ec6-2b99-5dda-ba0d-f01316fbc1a5","strapi_id":203,"menu":null}},{"strapi_id":98,"description":"\nWe assist with property investor and residence visa applications in Dubai. Investments over AED 1,000,000 qualify for a residency visa, but it's for residency only, not employment.","id":"2cfd918b-c53f-5c21-970d-8444e52668e1","image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Investor_Visa_4f7be6a41a.jpg"},"cta":{"cta_label":"Investor Visa","custom_link":null,"isExternal":false,"icon":null,"id":"785bb850-188f-5ecb-bb05-c38e1273fcbf","strapi_id":204,"menu":null}},{"strapi_id":100,"description":"We assist by ensuring you have the essential Title Deed, a crucial proof of ownership required for